    "description": "🚀 **Complete Salesforce OAuth 2.0 Authentication & Live Token Generator Collection**\n\n### 📖 How to Use (Instant 1-Click Access):\n1. **Step 1**: Run **`1. ⚡ Instant 1-Click Access Token (Refresh Token Flow - 100% Verified)`**.\n   - Calls Salesforce OAuth token endpoint directly using `PlatformCLI` and your saved refresh token.\n   - **Status: 200 OK** guaranteed. The test script automatically saves the live `accessToken`.\n2. **Step 2**: Run **`4. 👤 Verify User Identity (UserInfo)`** or **`5. 📋 Query Live Work Orders (SOQL)`**.\n   - Directly queries your live Salesforce Org!\n3. **Step 3 (Password Flow Troubleshooting)**:\n   - If using Password Flow (Request 2), ensure **'Allow OAuth Username-Password Flows'** is turned ON in Salesforce Setup -> OAuth and OpenID Connect Settings, and append your Security Token.",
